2. A second `.oxlintrc.json` or an `eslint.config.*` under apps/ or packages/.
   - adv 2: seeded temp tree with `.oxlintrc.json` in a workspace root and one
     level deeper, `eslint.config.mjs`, `eslint.config.js`, and a nested
